dialect protocol
protocol stdio.md.diff
version 1
schema stdio.md
start record

# P2-FG1: REAL binary diff frame, replacing F6's `print_diff().into_bytes()` text-as-binary
# shortcut (`../../🦀️component.rs`'s old `DiffCodec::encode_diff`) -- per the P2-W0 census 100% of
# stdio's `DiffCodec` impls were still on this shortcut. Same structural reasoning as the sibling
# `../../🧬️mutations/💾️binary/📡️component.protocol.semio` (read that file's comment for the full
# `DslField`/recursion rationale -- it applies identically here, `MdBlocksDiff`/`MdBlockDiff` are
# the diff-shaped twin of the same recursive `MdBlock`/collection-triple problem): `format u8` +
# `has_value u8` (0 = `MdDiff{blocks:None}`, i.e. no change; 1 = present) as two real fixed fields,
# then the recursive `MdBlocksDiff` payload (when present) as one opaque trailing `bytes` chain --
# real LEB128-varint-framed binary (`enc_blocks_diff_bin`/`dec_blocks_diff_bin` in the same
# `../../🦀️component.rs`), honestly opaque at THIS layer for the identical `Prim::Ref`
# protocol-recursion gap documented in the mutations sibling file (filed once, in this wave's
# `mechanism_gaps`, applies to both facets).
framing record
header fixed 2
field format u8
field has_value u8
chain payload bytes
